<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib38.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Attention is all you need, 2023.
</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib38.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">URL </span><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762</a><span id="bib.bib38.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.
</span>
</span></li>
      
