<section id="A5.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.4 </span>Experiment with accuracy</h3>

<div id="A5.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we present the performance and accuracy-based deltas of various hallucination prediction methods. The results exhibit trends similar to those observed when using AUROC as the evaluation metric.</p>
</div>
