<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Instruction prompts</h2>

<div id="A6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we compile the instructional prompts employed in our study. Terms marked with <math id="A6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\underline{\texttt{underline}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><munder accentunder="true"><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">underline</mtext><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></munder><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\underline{\texttt{underline}}</annotation></semantics></math> indicate placeholders that need to be filled with the corresponding content.</p>
</div>
<div id="A6.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.p2.1" class="ltx_p">A. Normal instruction template</p>
</div>
<div id="A6.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="58.21" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 58.21" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,58.21) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 6.01 L 0 52.2 C 0 55.52 2.69 58.21 6.01 58.21 L 471.36 58.21 C 474.68 58.21 477.38 55.52 477.38 52.2 L 477.38 6.01 C 477.38 2.69 474.68 0 471.36 0 L 6.01 0 C 2.69 0 0 2.69 0 6.01 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 2.08 6.01 L 2.08 52.2 C 2.08 54.38 3.84 56.14 6.01 56.14 L 471.36 56.14 C 473.54 56.14 475.3 54.38 475.3 52.2 L 475.3 6.01 C 475.3 3.84 473.54 2.08 471.36 2.08 L 6.01 2.08 C 3.84 2.08 2.08 3.84 2.08 6.01 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.76 17.35)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:27.27em;--ltx-fo-height:1.95em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="30.44" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 26.98)" width="377.34"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:27.27em;">
<span id="A6.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Question]:{<span id="A6.p3.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_medium">question</span>} [Answer]:</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A6.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.p4.1" class="ltx_p">B. SCAO instruction template</p>
</div>
<div id="A6.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.p5.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="74.82" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 74.82" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,74.82) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 6.01 L 0 68.81 C 0 72.13 2.69 74.82 6.01 74.82 L 471.36 74.82 C 474.68 74.82 477.38 72.13 477.38 68.81 L 477.38 6.01 C 477.38 2.69 474.68 0 471.36 0 L 6.01 0 C 2.69 0 0 2.69 0 6.01 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 2.08 6.01 L 2.08 68.81 C 2.08 70.98 3.84 72.74 6.01 72.74 L 471.36 72.74 C 473.54 72.74 475.3 70.98 475.3 68.81 L 475.3 6.01 C 475.3 3.84 473.54 2.08 471.36 2.08 L 6.01 2.08 C 3.84 2.08 2.08 3.84 2.08 6.01 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.76 17.35)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:27.27em;--ltx-fo-height:3.15em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="47.05" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 43.59)" width="377.34"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.p5.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:27.27em;">
<span id="A6.p5.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p5.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Question]: {<span id="A6.p5.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_medium">question</span>} You must answer in only one word. [Answer]:</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A6.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.p6.1" class="ltx_p">C. G-eval instruction template</p>
</div>
<div id="A6.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.p7.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="270.61" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 270.61" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,270.61) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 6.01 L 0 264.6 C 0 267.92 2.69 270.61 6.01 270.61 L 471.36 270.61 C 474.68 270.61 477.38 267.92 477.38 264.6 L 477.38 6.01 C 477.38 2.69 474.68 0 471.36 0 L 6.01 0 C 2.69 0 0 2.69 0 6.01 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 2.08 6.01 L 2.08 264.6 C 2.08 266.77 3.84 268.54 6.01 268.54 L 471.36 268.54 C 473.54 268.54 475.3 266.77 475.3 264.6 L 475.3 6.01 C 475.3 3.84 473.54 2.08 471.36 2.08 L 6.01 2.08 C 3.84 2.08 2.08 3.84 2.08 6.01 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.76 13.89)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:27.27em;--ltx-fo-height:17.55em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="242.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 242.84)" width="377.34"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.p7.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:27.27em;">
<span id="A6.p7.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p7.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Instruction] The text enclosed within triple backticks (“‘) is an agent’s answer to a given question ([Question]).</span></span>
<span id="A6.p7.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p7.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Your task is to evaluate whether the agent’s response is factually correct.</span></span>
<span id="A6.p7.pic1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p7.pic1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">.</span></span>
<span id="A6.p7.pic1.1.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p7.pic1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1) Analyze and explain whether the answer contains any factual inaccuracies.</span></span>
<span id="A6.p7.pic1.1.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p7.pic1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2) Then, classify the answer as either "True" (only factually correct contents) or "False" (containing any factually incorrect content).</span></span>
<span id="A6.p7.pic1.1.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p7.pic1.1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">.</span></span>
<span id="A6.p7.pic1.1.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p7.pic1.1.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">“‘</span></span>
